 "stimulus_html": "<p>Use the following table to answer questions 2 – 5.</p>\n<p>Here are some lengths and widths of a rectangle whose perimeter is 20 meters.</p>\n<table class=\"os-raise-wideequaltable unnumbered\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Row</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Length (meters)</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Width (meters)</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Area (square meters)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>a</td>\n      <td>1</td>\n      <td>9</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>b</td>\n      <td>3</td>\n      <td>7</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>c</td>\n      <td>5</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>d</td>\n      <td>7</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>e</td>\n      <td>9</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>",
